{"id":"85c9ab4a34ec968f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialSet.md","title":"SimplicialSet","display":"SimplicialSet","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SimplicialSet","parameters":["X","R"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SimplicialSet"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>X</span><span>R</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小拟范畴语义。有序参数：<code>X</code>、<code>R</code>。</p>\n<p>X_n 可为空；R 是 Δ 箭头的反变集合映射，方向为 X_n→X_m。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SimplicialSet X R)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (exists w (and (@ Omega w) (@ FunDom X w)))\n  (and\n    (@ Fun R)\n    (and\n      (exists A (and (@ Dom R A) (forall q (iff (in q A) (@ DeltaKey q)))))\n      (and\n        (forall m\n          (forall n\n            (forall f\n              (implies\n                (@ DeltaArrow m n f)\n                (exists M\n                  (exists N\n                    (exists h (and (@ App X m M) (and (@ App X n N) (and (@ SimpRestriction R m n f h) (@ Map h N M)))))))))))\n        (and\n          (forall n\n            (implies\n              (@ Nat n)\n              (exists nn\n                (exists f\n                  (exists N\n                    (exists h\n                      (and\n                        (@ Succ n nn)\n                        (and (@ Identity nn f) (and (@ App X n N) (and (@ SimpRestriction R n n f h) (@ Identity N h)))))))))))\n          (forall l\n            (forall m\n              (forall n\n                (forall g\n                  (forall f\n                    (forall h\n                      (implies\n                        (and (@ DeltaArrow l m g) (and (@ DeltaArrow m n f) (@ Compose g f h)))\n                        (exists rg\n                          (exists rf\n                            (exists rh\n                            (exists cmp\n                            (and\n                            (@ SimpRestriction R l m g rg)\n                            (and\n                            (@ SimpRestriction R m n f rf)\n                            (and (@ SimpRestriction R l n h rh) (and (@ Compose rf rg cmp) (= cmp rh)))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"577620d5d7b63059\" href=\"?note=577620d5d7b63059\" title=\"ZFC_Compose\">Compose</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"214537992e13e711\" href=\"?note=214537992e13e711\" title=\"ZFC_DeltaArrow\">DeltaArrow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ae67472b40c6e30\" href=\"?note=0ae67472b40c6e30\" title=\"ZFC_DeltaKey\">DeltaKey</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"77a3b1b0b64f2abf\" href=\"?note=77a3b1b0b64f2abf\" title=\"ZFC_Dom\">Dom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"eff666f032881d1b\" href=\"?note=eff666f032881d1b\" title=\"ZFC_Fun\">Fun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44cb62239daefca4\" href=\"?note=44cb62239daefca4\" title=\"ZFC_Identity\">Identity</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" href=\"?note=bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" title=\"ZFC_SimpRestriction\">SimpRestriction</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SimplicialSet X R)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Compose|Compose]]；[[ZFC_DeltaArrow|DeltaArrow]]；[[ZFC_DeltaKey|DeltaKey]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Identity|Identity]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Compose","status":"resolved","id":"577620d5d7b63059","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Compose|Compose]]；[[ZFC_DeltaArrow|DeltaArrow]]；[[ZFC_DeltaKey|DeltaKey]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_Fun|Fun]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Identity|Identity]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_DeltaArr